OL,3,AHead-on collision between bus and lorry
OL,4,Ain Brazil kills more than 20
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 21 people have been killed and
OL,7,Fanother four injured in a head-on
OL,8,Fcollision between a minibus and a lorry
OL,9,Fin southern Brazil, local officials
OL,10,Fsay.
OL,12,FThe crash happened at around 04:30
OL,13,Flocal time (07:30 GMT) on the BR-373
OL,14,Fhighway in the southern state of
OL,15,FParana.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
