OL,3,AHead-on collision between bus and lorry
OL,4,Ain Brazil kills more than 20
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal media reported that the minibus
OL,7,Fbelonged to the health authorities of
OL,8,Fthe nearby city of Imbituva and was
OL,9,Ftransporting patients and their
OL,10,Frelatives to health appointments in
OL,11,FPonta Grossa, some 60km (36 miles)
OL,12,Faway.
OL,14,FAuthorities have opened an
OL,15,Finvestigation to determine what may
OL,16,Fhave caused the two vehicles to crash
OL,17,Finto each other.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
